      "customfield_10050": "TC-PAY-005",
      "description": "Implement AES-256-GCM encryption for all cardholder data stored in mfs_payments_db on pghost-prod-01.mfs.internal. Uses svc-token-vault service account for key retrieval from HSM.\n\nAcceptance Criteria:\n- All PAN, CVV, and expiry data encrypted at rest\n- Encryption/decryption latency < 10ms\n- Key stored in HSM, never in application memory beyond transaction scope\n- Audit log for all decryption operations in mfs_audit_db\n\nGitLab MR: !401\nChange Request: CHG0090201\nTest Case: TC-PAY-005",
